  "solution": {
    "text": "Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>&#39;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>as</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>&#39;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>&#39;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>as</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>&#39;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>&#39;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> to be differentiable at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>&#39;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced></math> must be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>. Else, it is non-differentiable.</p>",
